{"title":"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c5103d378f167b23bd1dea0464c585ce77558c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.000 + 0.101 + 0.011 + 0.001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"234\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37efd8b45ad9ae6e3d00fbd5a88e8deff738358b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1.112 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1.113 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 1.111 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1.1111 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1.101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"559\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21a750d7cc90f4d0d5d07970a06cc041b58b8fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.000 + 0.101 + 0.011 + 0.001 = 1.101 + 0.011 + 0.001 = 1.112 + 0.001 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1.113}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"668\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gaus